1
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,560
Hey.

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,300
Dan!

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,080
What are you doing?

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,520
Studying, obviously.

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,760
Can't you tell?

6
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,920
What on earth are you reading?

7
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,280
You should read some of this too.

8
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,740
Yeah, right. I don't understand a thing.

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,020
Why don't you just study on your own?

10
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,460
Pond! / Hey!

11
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,360
Oh, Kaen.

12
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,320
Water?

13
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,240
Thanks!

14
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,580
You didn't bring any for me at all.

15
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,080
Let's share then.

16
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,140
Is it really that painful to watch?

17
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,880
You're no help at all, man.

18
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,900
Oh, right.

19
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,400
Don't tell me that...

20
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,500
The reason you're sitting right here...

21
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:41,120
You already knew, so why bother asking?

22
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:44,120
Ah, this guy's scheme runs deep!

23
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,120
So how is it?

24
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:48,540
Just look over there.

25
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,980
Yeah... all I can do is watch.

26
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:56,960
Poor guy, my friend...

27
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:01,440
EP. 12 Presuming

28
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:21,160
What are you doing?

29
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,180
Where are you packing up to go?

30
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:26,360
My condo repairs are finished.

31
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,100
And you're just leaving?

32
00:02:29,100 --> 00:02:30,560
Right now?

33
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:32,960
Yeah.

34
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,720
Well, my condo repairs are done.

35
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,000
Oh.

36
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:41,060
So you already planned this with him, huh?

37
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,800
What kind of game are you playing?

38
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:50,200
Are my feelings just a joke to you?

39
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,840
The moment he shows up, you just leave.

40
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,940
If you two love each other so much,

41
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:59,180
why didn't you move in together from the start?

42
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:00,120
What are you talking about?

43
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:06,460
You know full well in your heart.

44
00:03:06,780 --> 00:03:08,620
Coming and going as you please.

45
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:10,800
Leaving whenever you want.

46
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,560
Your heart is really that easy, isn't it?

47
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:16,900
Aren't you the one who finds it so easy?

48
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:19,060
You have an issue with me, but instead of clearing it up with me,

49
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:21,040
you go off laughing with someone else?

50
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,280
Is this what it's going to be like?

51
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,480
Is this the future I have to face?

52
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:27,080
Or in reality...

53
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:30,900
you never wanted me in your future from the beginning?

54
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:38,120
I shouldn't have wasted my time being serious with you.

55
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:44,980
If being serious with me was such a waste of time...

56
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,360
then just stop.

57
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,320
P'Dan...

58
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,300
Since when, right?

59
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:54,860
High school, wasn't it?

60
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:56,240
Are you kicking me out?

61
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:59,200
At least he seems much better suited for you than I am.

62
00:04:02,420 --> 00:04:04,720
Is your heart really that easy?

63
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:07,820
I thought I was the only one you'd give a chance to.

64
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:10,720
But someone like you...

65
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,000
gives chances to every single one of your exes, huh?

66
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,100
Yeah.

67
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,280
I'm just easy.

68
00:04:20,180 --> 00:04:21,680
I've always been easy with you.

69
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:23,960
I was even easy with you that night.

70
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:24,620
Hey!

71
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:27,820
If you're so easy...

72
00:04:28,980 --> 00:04:29,880
then just go!

73
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,920
Pack your stuff and get out!

74
00:04:56,180 --> 00:04:57,600
I'm leaving now.

75
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:26,540
Dan...

76
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,180
Are you really okay?

77
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,780
Hey, it's alright, man.

78
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,220
Come on, let me carry that for you.

79
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,600
Let's get in the car.

80
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,420
Give me a hug.

81
00:06:08,900 --> 00:06:10,300
Who hurt you, P'Dan?

82
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:12,720
Not me, that's for sure.

83
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:16,680
It was you!

84
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:18,120
What?

85
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,780
Oh.

86
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,400
I knew it.

87
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,920
You've had red eyes the whole way here...

88
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,380
It's because of this, isn't it?

89
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,880
Well, it's your fault!

90
00:06:33,580 --> 00:06:34,760
Wait, wait a minute.

91
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,400
Stop arguing for a second and please explain to me.

92
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,900
What on earth happened?

93
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,720
Why are you crying?

94
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,160
I'm not crying anymore!

95
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:46,460
Dude...

96
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,680
When two people...

97
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,920
are together,

98
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,640
they need to speak nicely to each other!

99
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:53,800
Not like one is oil

100
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,280
and the other is fire.

101
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,780
Everything just goes up in flames like this!

102
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,960
*Sigh*

103
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:02,020
But he never talked to me like that before.

104
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:05,540
Maybe he's been thinking it all along,

105
00:07:05,540 --> 00:07:07,100
he just never told me.

106
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:12,520
Are you sure you're not just overthinking it?

107
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:16,120
You're head over heels in love, what would you know?

108
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,220
Whoa...

109
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:20,640
Before I got to be head over heels, I almost went crazy first, okay?

110
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,760
Yeah!

111
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:23,440
Give him some advice!

112
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:25,180
You just stay out of this!

113
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,220
Hey!

114
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:28,080
I've been doing good all along, man!

115
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:29,440
"Good" my ass!

116
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:32,120
That's enough.

117
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,800
I'm sulking with you now.

118
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,500
When you talk like this, I'm done.

119
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:37,060
Go to work on your own tomorrow.

120
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,720
I'm not picking you up anymore!

121
00:07:39,180 --> 00:07:39,700
Done!

122
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:41,940
I'm mad at you.

123
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:44,180
Hey...

124
00:07:44,180 --> 00:07:45,520
What should we do? Follow him?

125
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,720
No need to follow him, P'.

126
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:49,220
He's not actually mad at me.

127
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,760
He just feels guilty.

128
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:54,080
Honestly, he doesn't even need to feel guilty...

129
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,620
If Pond would just listen to me for once.

130
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,200
Pond?

131
00:07:59,420 --> 00:08:00,360
The guy from Phrae?

132
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,560
The one who broke your heart back then?

133
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:06,700
How did you guys meet up again?

134
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,580
Do you have three days to spare to listen?

135
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:16,120
Oh, I have plenty of time to listen and comfort you.

136
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,900
Don't cry.

137
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:21,680
You have to comfort me, okay?

138
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,700
Aww...

139
00:08:24,580 --> 00:08:26,240
It's okay.

140
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:26,740
There, there.

141
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:38,320
Looks good!

142
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,960
Of course it does.

143
00:08:39,340 --> 00:08:40,020
What is this?

144
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:40,780
Iridescent shark catfish?

145
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:44,300
Catfish my ass! / It's salmon.

146
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:45,360
What's this one?

147
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,280
Can't you see? / Misua noodles.

148
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:48,320
I'll smack you in a second!

149
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,660
It's spaghetti, you idiot!

150
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:50,820
Oh really? Oh really? / Yeah!

151
00:08:50,820 --> 00:08:51,860
Hey!

152
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:53,440
Looks yummy, can I have some?

153
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,580
Can I get Tom Yum?

154
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,640
Buy it yourself!

155
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,300
Aww, stingy!

156
00:08:56,300 --> 00:08:56,780
Hey!

157
00:08:57,380 --> 00:08:59,380
Khun Tang-Oh, P'Dan, you eat at this place too?

158
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,480
Yes.

159
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,180
Then today I'll sit next to Kaen instead.

160
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,200
I want to sit on the comfy sofa.

161
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:12,780
Oh?

162
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:22,300
Khun Tang-Oh and P'Dan seem to be getting along really well, huh?

163
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:27,340
I guess so.

164
00:09:29,340 --> 00:09:31,580
Are you okay with this, Pond?

165
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:33,680
How could I be okay, Kaen?

166
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:38,540
Where should we even start helping?

167
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,940
You need to put me in...

168
00:09:44,300 --> 00:09:45,880
a better mood first!

169
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,400
That Khun Tang-Oh...

170
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,420
He's not handsome at all.

171
00:09:54,780 --> 00:09:56,300
Can't even compete with Pond.

172
00:09:56,300 --> 00:09:58,580
P'Dan is totally blind.

173
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:01,420
Mm...

174
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:03,040
A bit more and I'll be satisfied.

175
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:06,760
My friend here...

176
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,480
is as handsome as Park Seo-jun!

177
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:10,340
If P'Dan doesn't choose him,

178
00:10:10,340 --> 00:10:12,000
he's out of his mind.

179
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,540
Park Seo-jun, seriously?

180
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:17,580
Can I get a little more?

181
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:18,900
Kaen, a bit more please?

182
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,920
Pond and P'Dan are the ultimate match.

183
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,620
Just like male and female leads!

184
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,520
Khun Tang-Oh can only be the second lead,

185
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:28,780
who never gets the main character!

186
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,580
Hey, that was good!

187
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:32,160
Whoa... I feel...

188
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,820
My ears are totally cleared!

189
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:38,260
Through the right ear, out the left ear,

190
00:10:38,260 --> 00:10:39,740
and back to understanding in the middle.

191
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:40,860
Ah... so refreshing!

192
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,600
Is it really that much?

193
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,180
Hey, Dan.

194
00:10:48,020 --> 00:10:49,820
If you're eating, look at your food!

195
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:51,400
Are you gonna get full just staring at the kid?

196
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:55,200
Yeah, I'm full.

197
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:55,940
Hey!

198
00:10:55,940 --> 00:10:57,800
Full from what? You haven't taken a single bite!

199
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,560
Hurry up and eat.

200
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,460
Do you think...

201
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:13,640
Kaen and Pond look good together?

202
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,500
Look at you...

203
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,080
In the end,

204
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,680
you just sit there staring at him like back in 12th grade.

205
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,980
Yeah, and back then...

206
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:26,560
If I hadn't cut you off,

207
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,800
I bet you would've confessed your love already.

208
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:30,920
Don't speak so loud!

209
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:32,380
What's up?

210
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,660
Okay, okay, okay.

211
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,920
I won't bring it up anymore.

212
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,720
How's Best doing?

213
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,520
I feel like he completely vanished.

214
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:44,060
Just working all day long.

215
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:46,640
Is he trying to win a shield...

216
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,080
or win a trophy?

217
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:51,300
Probably trying to win the company owner's younger brother.

218
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:52,500
Huh?

219
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,680
Do you have some free time?

220
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:58,140
Give me 3 minutes and I'll tell you the story.

221
00:12:00,100 --> 00:12:01,980
Sure, I have the whole day free for you!

222
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:26,860
P'Dan.

223
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,400
Huh?

224
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,400
Pond said that...

225
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:33,380
if I want to move on...

226
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,380
I should ask for your advice.

227
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,320
Me?

228
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,620
Yeah.

229
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,940
P'Best...

230
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:44,040
he prefers women more.

231
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,220
If you prefer women,

232
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:50,860
why didn't you just say so from the beginning?

233
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,260
Uh...

234
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:54,320
I think...

235
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:57,100
he doesn't really prefer that.

236
00:12:57,100 --> 00:12:59,320
Doesn't prefer it? Look at that, P'!

237
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,860
He smiles way wider than when he's with me.

238
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:07,660
Maybe it's just for work?

239
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:11,520
First time I've seen people do work like this.

240
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:14,680
Maybe it makes the work go smoother?

241
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:16,880
She's a TikToker, after all.

242
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,480
Smooth my foot.

243
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:21,660
I think your friend...

244
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:23,540
just doesn't know how to reject people.

245
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:27,440
Even though he didn't like me, he still spared my feelings like this.

246
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,760
Oh, Tontae.

247
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:44,440
P'Dan!

248
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,040
Let's make some content!

249
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:50,060
P'Best doesn't know how to do it at all. It's so annoying!

250
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:50,720
Ah...

251
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,720
I have to get back to work now.

252
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:55,060
Can we do the content later?

253
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:58,500
Ugh, P'Dan, you're no fun at all!

254
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,960
This is all the help I can give you.

255
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:03,880
Are you staying with P'Best?

256
00:14:04,340 --> 00:14:05,820
Come on, please?

257
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:34,960
How is it, P'Dan?

258
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:36,840
Feeling uncomfortable, right?

259
00:14:37,620 --> 00:14:39,280
And what about the work...

260
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:41,280
that needs to be sent to Khun Paeng?

261
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,420
Have you sorted it out?

262
00:14:42,420 --> 00:14:44,180
Almost done.

263
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,980
Right.

264
00:14:46,980 --> 00:14:49,340
And regarding Pond's farewell party...

265
00:14:49,340 --> 00:14:52,940
Som-O said we'll throw a welcome party for Kaen at the same time. Is that okay?

266
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,860
Can anyone even say "not okay" to P'Som-O's plans?

267
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,500
You're his mentor.

268
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:03,360
You should be a bit more professional.

269
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:06,240
Talking about me... You don't look at yourself at all, do you?

270
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:11,700
Oh, and the task that got stuck with a bug,

271
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:12,960
will you clear it in time?

272
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:15,680
Khun Ton already signed the contract with Tang-Oh.

273
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:18,920
Then you can tell Tontae to send Khun Paeng's layout straight to me.

274
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:27,400
Be a professional, right?

275
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,420
I'll just let Pond handle it instead.

276
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:33,780
Don't go bothering him.

277
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:37,760
His internship is almost over. Just leave him be.

278
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,680
Hey...

279
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:48,500
Just looking at his desk...

280
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:51,080
makes my heart flutter, P'Dan.

281
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,260
What do you expect me to talk to him about?

282
00:15:53,660 --> 00:15:57,820
I'm definitely telling Khun Ton that you're unfit to be a team lead.

283
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:03,420
And as for your own situation...

284
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:06,080
You haven't even given him a chance yet.

285
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,820
I gave him way more than a chance.

286
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:15,000
I don't even know if the chance he gave me...

287
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,500
was real in the first place.

288
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,760
You have to give yourself a chance too.

289
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,740
Listen to his apology.

290
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:26,000
And why would he come to apologize to me?

291
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:30,140
Wouldn't it be better if he spent that time with the person he actually belongs with?

292
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:43,820
Take your medicine, man. You look so pale lately.

293
00:16:43,820 --> 00:16:45,240
Yeah.

294
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,420
Hurry up and clear your work too.

295
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:48,680
Alright.

